      "date": "2026-08-29 04:48:08.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(1 comment)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nLooks good. The refcount arithmetic still balances on every path I traced: one launch equals one successful ib_post_send() equals one completion, and the two callers that do launch-then-decref (kefalnd_tx_complete() on IB_WC_REG_MR and kefalnd_handle_getr_ack()) can no longer drop the TX to zero while it is still queued. One readability note inline.",
